### filter by orgId.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&countForEachList=0&organizationId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the list level.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&countForEachList=1
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the organization level
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&countForEachList=0
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
